동</a></div></div><h2 style=\"margin:52px 0 22px;padding:26px 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #dce5ef;border-bottom:2px solid #d5e3f2;font-size:25px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:700;color:#173a61;word-break:keep-all;\" id=\"b-learning-1\">1. 빈 설명을 실제 결과와 연결하기</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#26364a;\">시각적인 결과가 좋아도 어떤 판단으로 바뀌었는지 빠져 있으면 설계 과정을 설명하기 어렵습니다. 자신의 피드백에서 과정 기록, 필수 요소 대체, 직접 출처 부족이 언급되었다면 이 자료를 활용하세요.</p><table style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;margin:22px 0 30px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;border:1px solid #cdd9e6;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">단계</th><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">확인할 내용</th><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">작성할 결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">대응</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">초안·최종의 13개 번호와 역할</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">항목별 대응표</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">비평</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">초안의 구체적인 문제와 영향</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">문제 위치·사용자 불편</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">조사</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">참고 사례의 관찰·선택·배제 이유</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">직접 URL과 적용 원리</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">설명</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">최종 변경 또는 유지의 근거</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#f7f9fc;color:#26364a;\">항목 번호·웹 적용 위치</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote style=\"display:block;margin:26px 0 32px;padding:20px 24px;background-color:#edf6f1;border-left:4px solid #559479;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;color:#25493c;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">이미 만든 결과를 보고 실제 판단을 정리하세요. 당시 근거가 남아 있지 않다면 지금 새로 비교·검토한 내용을 적고, 하지 않은 조사를 과거 과정처럼 꾸미지 않습니다.</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#26364a;\">준비물은 자신의 초안·최종 스타일가이드, 두 HTML, 와이어프레임과 기획 문서입니다. 전체 약 60~80분을 권장하며 보완할 항목부터 나누어 진행해도 됩니다.</p><h2 style=\"margin:52px 0 22px;padding:26px 0 14px;border-top:1px solid #dce5ef;border-bottom:2px solid #d5e3f2;font-size:25px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:700;color:#173a61;word-break:keep-all;\" id=\"b-learning-2\">2. 필수 13개 항목부터 맞추기</h2><table style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;margin:22px 0 30px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;border:1px solid #cdd9e6;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">번호</th><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">기본 항목</th><th style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#e9f0f8;color:#26364a;font-weight:700;\">확인할 역할</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:22%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">표지</td><td style=\"padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #d3dfeb;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:39%;background-color:#fff;color:#26364a;\">브랜드·가이드의 정체성</td></tr><tr><td style=\